\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Overview of the HAACHAMA pipeline used to generate a deforming fish-shaped digital twin and a cylinder surrogate. Infrared video provided the fish trajectory and body contour, while three wall-mounted sensors recorded experimental pressure. The fish-shaped digital twin and cylinder were driven by the same centre-of-mass trajectory. The pink centre-of-mass marker is a conceptual annotation added to help relate the experimental and simulated representations. It is not an output generated by the flow simulation or a direct result of the segmentation.}}{3}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:haachama}{{1}{3}{Overview of the HAACHAMA pipeline used to generate a deforming fish-shaped digital twin and a cylinder surrogate. Infrared video provided the fish trajectory and body contour, while three wall-mounted sensors recorded experimental pressure. The fish-shaped digital twin and cylinder were driven by the same centre-of-mass trajectory. The pink centre-of-mass marker is a conceptual annotation added to help relate the experimental and simulated representations. It is not an output generated by the flow simulation or a direct result of the segmentation}{figure.1}{}}
\newlabel{fig:haachama@cref}{{[figure][1][]1}{[1][3][]3}}
